      "notes": "Deals the batch items three at a time into Fire Lanes. Each item goes to exactly one lane call, once; the loop only advances after all three lanes answered, so at most three batches are ever in flight. The done output fires when the items drain; Stop? ends the loop early after a batch whose paid tiers all died."
