      "executeOnce": true,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "notes": "The hand-off, once per lane group (ruled 2026-09-02): Waterfall Emails' record door (Record Webhook -> Params reads body.table, body.baseId, body.clientRecordId, body.view; the door resolves the People table by name). Body {table: \"People\", baseId, clientRecordId, view: \"Not Waterfalled\"}. Fired without waiting for its answer: the door responds at its last node, so the 5 s timeout here is expected and counts as fired; the email waterfall keeps running and writes its own log row. A 4xx/5xx or a refused connection counts as a failed hand-off."
    },
